  "finding": "Both v2 installed diagnostic clients fail the first real signed policy push at the read-timeout setter with EINVAL22 after successful authentication and request write/flush. Both actual Mac closed-peer controls reproduce setter rejection while a complete bound reply remains readable.",
  "interpretation_limits": [
    "v1 did not distinguish timeout configuration from the actual read syscall.",
    "The explicit diagnostic client sends one request; the original Python publisher uses a persistent framed client.",
    "A diagnostic feature build and a single cold sample per platform are not default-runtime startup or performance qualification.",
    "All four failed observations retain ACKfalse, authenticated_stop_succeededfalse, containedfalse and observation_completefalse; direct-child reaping and absent resident state do not prove full containment.",
    "The Mac-only product implementation and four new product controls have not yet run on hosted Macs."
  ],
